{"seq":2,"slug":"improvement-action-recommend","title":"改进建议与优先级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-discoverability-listing-seo/discoverability-scoring/improvement-action-recommend","wordCount":2352,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"改进建议与优先级\">改进建议与优先级</h1><p>一个 62 分的商品，商家该先改标题还是先补属性？如果工具只回答&quot;分数低&quot;，这个问题就落在商家身上，而商家大概率会因为不知道从哪下手而什么都不做。这一篇要解决的是分数到动作的转换：从&quot;哪一项分数低&quot;到&quot;先做哪一件事收益最高&quot;，后者需要的是每个字段的<strong>边际收益估计</strong>，而不只是它的当前得分。</p>\n<p>它与 <a href=\"../discoverability-scoring/discoverability-score-model\">可发现性评分模型与维度</a> 的关系是&quot;定义 → 使用&quot;：那篇定义了维度，这篇要求每个维度都能算出一个&quot;改好它能涨多少&quot;的量。如果一个维度算不出这个量，它在建议排序里就无法参与，只能作为背景信息展示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>改进建议系统的核心量是<strong>机会分</strong>（opportunity），定义为&quot;某个字段从当前状态改善到目标状态后，该商品在目标查询集合上的预期可发现性提升&quot;。它与当前得分的区别在于：当前得分是状态描述，机会分是动作收益。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[商品评分明细] --&gt; O1[字段机会分估算]&#10;  G[可发现性缺口&lt;br/&gt;未召回的探测查询] --&gt; O1&#10;  T[类目基准线&lt;br/&gt;同类目同分位的常见值] --&gt; O1&#10;  O1 --&gt; P{优先级排序}&#10;  P --&gt; C1[成本: 改动难度&lt;br/&gt;商家填写工作量]&#10;  P --&gt; C2[收益: 预期召回提升&lt;br/&gt;× 该类目查询量]&#10;  C1 --&gt; R[建议列表&lt;br/&gt;按 收益/成本 排序]&#10;  C2 --&gt; R&#10;  R --&gt; M[取前 3 条呈现]\">graph TD\n  S[商品评分明细] --&gt; O1[字段机会分估算]\n  G[可发现性缺口&lt;br/&gt;未召回的探测查询] --&gt; O1\n  T[类目基准线&lt;br/&gt;同类目同分位的常见值] --&gt; O1\n  O1 --&gt; P{优先级排序}\n  P --&gt; C1[成本: 改动难度&lt;br/&gt;商家填写工作量]\n  P --&gt; C2[收益: 预期召回提升&lt;br/&gt;× 该类目查询量]\n  C1 --&gt; R[建议列表&lt;br/&gt;按 收益/成本 排序]\n  C2 --&gt; R\n  R --&gt; M[取前 3 条呈现]</pre><p>图中的 <code>T</code>（类目基准线）是让建议可执行的关键。没有基准线，&quot;属性覆盖度 0.5&quot; 是一个无法解读的数字；有了基准线，&quot;同类目同价位商家的中位数是 0.85，你落后 35 个百分点&quot;才是可行动的信息。</p>\n<h3 id=\"机会分的三个输入\">机会分的三个输入</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字段当前状态</td>\n<td>这一项现在多少分</td>\n<td>评分模型的分维度输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提升空间</td>\n<td>改好它能到多少分</td>\n<td>该项的满分定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>该字段的失效频率</td>\n<td>缺这个字段真的导致过漏召回吗</td>\n<td>缺口诊断的召回实测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三项是机会分区别于&quot;分差&quot;的地方，也是最容易被省略的一步。一个字段即使分低，如果缺口诊断显示它从未导致漏召回（因为该字段对应的查询在实际流量里很少），那么改它的收益接近零。把这一项纳入，需要建议系统与缺口诊断系统共享数据——这正是 <a href=\"../onsite-discoverability/discoverability-gap-diagnose\">可发现性缺口诊断</a>存在的意义之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"收益的估计方法\">收益的估计方法</h2><h3 id=\"用召回实测估计收益\">用召回实测估计收益</h3><p>最可靠的收益估计是实测：从商品的探测查询集里取出与目标字段相关的子集，分别计算&quot;字段修正前&quot;与&quot;字段修正后&quot;的召回与排名，差值即为收益。这个方法的问题是它需要&quot;修正后&quot;的状态——对存量商品可以用同类目已修正商品的表现做对照。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"estimate_gain(product, field):&#10;  probes = probe_queries(product)                     # 由商品字段反向生成的查询集&#10;  relevant = [q for q in probes if field_affects(q, field)]&#10;  if not relevant: return ZERO                        # 该字段不影响任何探测查询&#10;  peers = same_category_products_with_field_ok(field) # 同类目中该字段合格的对照商品&#10;  p_recall_before = mean(recall(product, q) for q in relevant)&#10;  p_recall_after  = mean(mean(recall(peer, q) for peer in peers) for q in relevant)&#10;  gain = max(p_recall_after - p_recall_before, 0)&#10;  volume = category_query_volume(relevant)            # 该类目相关查询的搜索量&#10;  return gain * volume                                # 预期曝光增量（相对量）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>estimate_gain(product, field):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  probes = probe_queries(product)                     # 由商品字段反向生成的查询集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  relevant = [q for q in probes if field_affects(q, field)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if not relevant: return ZERO                        # 该字段不影响任何探测查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  peers = same_category_products_with_field_ok(field) # 同类目中该字段合格的对照商品</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  p_recall_before = mean(recall(product, q) for q in relevant)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  p_recall_after  = mean(mean(recall(peer, q) for peer in peers) for q in relevant)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  gain = max(p_recall_after - p_recall_before, 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  volume = category_query_volume(relevant)            # 该类目相关查询的搜索量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return gain * volume                                # 预期曝光增量（相对量）</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>volume</code> 这一项把&quot;召回率提升 10 个百分点&quot;转换成&quot;预期多获得多少曝光&quot;。没有它，一个高频类目的属性缺失与一个冷门类目的属性缺失会被给出同样的优先级，而它们的业务价值差几个数量级。当收益需要以排序位置而非召回率衡量时，可用带位置折扣的指标（NDCG 的形式是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nDCG_p = \\frac{DCG_p}{IDCG_p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.528em;vertical-align:-0.5423em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5073em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5423em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>p</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DCG_p=\\sum_{i=1}^{p}\\frac{2^{rel_i}-1}{\\log_2(i+1)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.574em;vertical-align:-0.5311em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0429em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">l</span><span class=\"mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2341em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2659em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.927em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3448em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3147em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5311em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，完美排序为 1.0，见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Discounted_cumulative_gain\">Discounted cumulative gain</a>），它把排名越靠后的增益折得越低，与曝光收益的实际衰减一致。</p>\n<h3 id=\"收益估计的三类不确定性\">收益估计的三类不确定性</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>不确定性</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>召回实测的抽样误差</td>\n<td>探测查询集太小，估计不稳</td>\n<td>设最小探测集大小，不足则降级为规则估计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对照商品的可比性</td>\n<td>同类目对照品在价格、评价上有差异</td>\n<td>按价格带与评价数分层选对照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归因混淆</td>\n<td>曝光增量可能来自其他同时改动</td>\n<td>只作为优先级依据，不作为承诺</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三项必须在工具的表述里体现：给商家的建议应当是&quot;这一类改动通常带来 X 类提升&quot;，而不是&quot;改完预期涨 15%&quot;。把估计值说成承诺，会在实际结果不如预期时摧毁工具的信任。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本的度量与排序\">成本的度量与排序</h2><p>只按收益排序会把商家推向&quot;收益最高但工作量最大&quot;的建议，而这类建议的完成率极低。排序必须用&quot;收益 / 成本&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"成本的三个构成\">成本的三个构成</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本构成</th>\n<th>度量方式</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>认知成本</td>\n<td>商家是否需要先理解一个概念</td>\n<td>补&quot;归一化规格值&quot;需要理解枚举</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>操作成本</td>\n<td>需要手工填写的字段数</td>\n<td>补 3 个属性 vs 改 1 个标题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖成本</td>\n<td>是否需要上游信息（如供应商提供参数）</td>\n<td>补材质需要向供应商确认</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三类成本最容易被忽略，且是跨境场景下最常见的阻塞：商家不是不愿意填，而是不知道值是多少。对这类字段，工具的表述应从&quot;请填写材质&quot;改为&quot;请向供应商确认材质后填写&quot;，并且不应把它排在建议列表前面——一个无法完成的建议会消耗商家对整份列表的注意力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"排序规则\">排序规则</h3><p>综合起来，建议列表的排序规则可以写成：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>典型动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>P0</td>\n<td>关键轴缺失（总分被封顶）且无依赖成本</td>\n<td>补必填属性枚举值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P1</td>\n<td>关键轴缺失但有依赖成本</td>\n<td>向供应商确认后补填</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P2</td>\n<td>收益高、操作成本低</td>\n<td>标题核心词补充、后台关键词扩同义词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P3</td>\n<td>收益高但操作成本高</td>\n<td>重写描述、补多语言版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P4</td>\n<td>收益低（无相关查询流量）</td>\n<td>不出现在建议列表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>P4 的&quot;不出现&quot;是一个明确的设计决定：建议列表必须<strong>短且全可执行</strong>。给商家三十条建议的结果是一条都不做，这是商家侧工具最常见的失败。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批量场景下的优先级聚合\">批量场景下的优先级聚合</h2><p>第 4 章的批量审计需要把商品级建议聚合成商家可执行的批次。聚合不能简单按商品数量排序，而应按&quot;一次操作能覆盖多少商品&quot;排序。</p>\n<h3 id=\"聚合的两种模式\">聚合的两种模式</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>按字段聚合</strong>：同一字段在 N 个商品上缺失，给出一次批量填写入口。适合字段值可从商品自身数据推导的场景（如从标题里已出现的功率推导功率属性）。</li>\n<li><strong>按商品聚合</strong>：同一商品有多个字段待改，打包成一个待办。适合商品数量少、单商品改动价值高的场景（如主推款）。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"batch_recommendation:&#10;  mode: by_field | by_product&#10;  by_field_threshold: 50 # 同字段缺失商品数 ≥ 50 才聚合为批量任务&#10;  rank_by: expected_gain_total # 批量任务的收益 = 单品收益 × 覆盖商品数 × 完成率折扣&#10;  completion_rate_discount:&#10;    no_dependency: 0.7&#10;    has_dependency: 0.3 # 需要上游信息的批量任务完成率显著更低&#10;  max_tasks_per_merchant: 5\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">batch_recommendation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">by_field | by_product</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  by_field_threshold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 同字段缺失商品数 ≥ 50 才聚合为批量任务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rank_by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">expected_gain_total</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 批量任务的收益 = 单品收益 × 覆盖商品数 × 完成率折扣</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  completion_rate_discount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    no_dependency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    has_dependency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 需要上游信息的批量任务完成率显著更低</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  max_tasks_per_merchant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>completion_rate_discount</code> 这一项是把&quot;商家不会做完所有事&quot;这一现实编码进排序。一个覆盖 5000 商品但完成率只有 0.3 的批量任务，其预期收益低于一个覆盖 500 商品、完成率 0.7 的任务——而纯按覆盖数排序会给出相反的结论，且会让商家长期面对一份永远做不完的清单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"建议的呈现与反馈\">建议的呈现与反馈</h2><p>建议列表生成之后，还需要一个反馈闭环，否则模型永远不知道自己的估计准不准。</p>\n<h3 id=\"必须回流的三个信号\">必须回流的三个信号</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采纳率</td>\n<td>建议被采纳 / 被展示</td>\n<td>识别不可执行的建议类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采纳后分数变化</td>\n<td>改动前后该字段的得分</td>\n<td>校验字段检测逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采纳后曝光变化</td>\n<td>改动前后探测查询的召回与排名</td>\n<td>校验收益估计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二项是排查&quot;建议看起来改了但分数没动&quot;这类 bug 的唯一手段（常见根因是字段归一化未通过，值填了但没进枚举）。第三项是收益估计的校准数据来源，也是 <a href=\"../discoverability-scoring/score-traffic-correlation\">评分与流量/成交相关性验证</a>在单商品粒度上的对应物。三个信号缺任何一个，建议系统都会随时间漂移成一个越来越不准的静态规则集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>建议系统的核心量是机会分（改好能涨多少），而不是当前得分（现在多少分）；分差排序会让商家做低收益的事。</li>\n<li>机会分的三个输入是当前状态、提升空间、失效频率；第三项要求与缺口诊断共享数据，能剔除&quot;分低但无实际影响&quot;的字段。</li>\n<li>收益估计用召回实测加类目查询量加权，把召回率提升换算成预期曝光增量；对照商品需按价格带与评价数分层。</li>\n<li>收益估计只能作为优先级依据，不能对商家表述为承诺。</li>\n<li>排序必须用收益/成本；成本包含认知、操作、依赖三类，依赖成本（需向供应商确认）是最常见且最易被忽略的阻塞。</li>\n<li>建议列表必须短且全可执行，无相关查询流量的低收益项应完全不出现。</li>\n<li>批量场景按&quot;一次操作覆盖多少商品&quot;聚合，并把完成率折扣计入排序，否则会生成永远做不完的清单。</li>\n<li>采纳率、采纳后分数变化、采纳后曝光变化三个信号必须回流，否则建议集会退化为越来越不准的静态规则。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"改进建议与优先级","id":"改进建议与优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"机会分的三个输入","id":"机会分的三个输入"},{"level":2,"text":"收益的估计方法","id":"收益的估计方法"},{"level":3,"text":"用召回实测估计收益","id":"用召回实测估计收益"},{"level":3,"text":"收益估计的三类不确定性","id":"收益估计的三类不确定性"},{"level":2,"text":"成本的度量与排序","id":"成本的度量与排序"},{"level":3,"text":"成本的三个构成","id":"成本的三个构成"},{"level":3,"text":"排序规则","id":"排序规则"},{"level":2,"text":"批量场景下的优先级聚合","id":"批量场景下的优先级聚合"},{"level":3,"text":"聚合的两种模式","id":"聚合的两种模式"},{"level":2,"text":"建议的呈现与反馈","id":"建议的呈现与反馈"},{"level":3,"text":"必须回流的三个信号","id":"必须回流的三个信号"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可发现性评分模型与维度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-discoverability-listing-seo/discoverability-scoring/discoverability-score-model"},"next":{"title":"评分与流量/成交相关性验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-discoverability-listing-seo/discoverability-scoring/score-traffic-correlation"}}